{"seq":2,"slug":"randomness-noise","title":"随机性与噪声函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations/randomness-noise","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"随机性与噪声函数\">随机性与噪声函数</h1><p>如果你用 <code>rand()</code> 给每个像素填一个高度值，得到的是一片电视雪花——刺眼、不连续、毫无地貌可言。真实的山脉之所以&quot;看起来像山&quot;，是因为相邻的点高度相近、不同尺度的起伏叠在一起。从&quot;白噪声雪花&quot;到&quot;可信地貌&quot;的全部秘密，藏在两类东西里：可复现的伪随机数，以及空间上连续的噪声函数。它们是几乎所有 PCG 的原料层，本篇专讲这层原料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PCG 里的&quot;随机&quot;几乎从不用真随机，而用伪随机数生成器（PRNG）。原因是可复现性：同一个种子（seed）喂进同一个 PRNG，永远产出同一串数。这让&quot;《我的世界》的世界种子&quot;成为可能——你把种子发给朋友，他生成出的世界和你一模一样，因为整个世界其实是种子的确定性函数。可复现性也是运行时分块生成的基石，详见 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/runtime-streaming\">运行时生成与流式世界</a>。</p>\n<p>噪声函数则解决&quot;空间连续性&quot;。它把坐标映射到一个值，且保证相邻坐标的值平滑过渡。下表区分两类原料：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>本质</th>\n<th>关键性质</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>伪随机数（PRNG）</td>\n<td>标量序列</td>\n<td>可复现、均匀分布、无空间结构</td>\n<td>种子、抽奖、骰子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值噪声 / 梯度噪声</td>\n<td>坐标→值的场</td>\n<td>空间连续、可分尺度</td>\n<td>地形高度、纹理、云</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希函数</td>\n<td>坐标→伪随机值</td>\n<td>无状态、可并行、确定性</td>\n<td>分块种子、按坐标采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[坐标 x,y] --&gt; B[空间哈希]&#10;  B --&gt; C[每个格点的伪随机梯度]&#10;  C --&gt; D[梯度噪声 Perlin/Simplex]&#10;  D --&gt; E[分形布朗运动&lt;br/&gt;多倍频叠加]&#10;  E --&gt; F[高度图 / 纹理 / 密度场]&#10;  F --&gt; G[地形/云/生物群系]\">graph TD\n  A[坐标 x,y] --&gt; B[空间哈希]\n  B --&gt; C[每个格点的伪随机梯度]\n  C --&gt; D[梯度噪声 Perlin/Simplex]\n  D --&gt; E[分形布朗运动&lt;br/&gt;多倍频叠加]\n  E --&gt; F[高度图 / 纹理 / 密度场]\n  F --&gt; G[地形/云/生物群系]</pre><h2 id=\"伪随机数与种子的可复现性\">伪随机数与种子的可复现性</h2><p>一个 PRNG 是一个确定性状态机：内部状态经过固定变换吐出下一个数。常见的有线性同余（LCG，快但质量差）、Mersenne Twister（周期极长，曾是默认）、以及现代游戏偏爱的 PCG 系列与 xoshiro/xorshift（速度与统计质量兼优）。选择标准不是&quot;多随机&quot;，而是周期长度、统计均匀性与速度的平衡。</p>\n<p>种子管理是 PCG 工程里最容易被低估的细节。一个常见做法是层级种子（hierarchical seeding）：用世界种子派生出区块种子，再派生出该区块内各对象的种子，每一层都用确定性哈希。这样既保证整体可复现，又让不同区块能独立、并行生成而互不干扰——这正是无限世界能并行流式生成的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"梯度噪声-perlin-与-simplex\">梯度噪声：Perlin 与 Simplex</h2><p>Ken Perlin 在 1983 年为电影《电子世界争霸战》发明的 Perlin 噪声，是把白噪声变&quot;自然&quot;的转折点。它的思路是：在整数格点上放置伪随机梯度向量，对任意查询点，取其周围格点梯度与偏移向量的点积，再用平滑插值混合。这保证了输出在空间上连续可微，看起来像有机的起伏而非雪花。</p>\n<p>Perlin 在 2001 年又提出 Simplex 噪声以解决两个缺陷：高维下 Perlin 的计算量随维度指数增长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个角点），且存在方向性伪影。Simplex 改用单纯形（二维是三角形而非正方形）划分空间，角点数降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在三维及以上明显更快、伪影更少。下表对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>噪声</th>\n<th>角点数（n 维）</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>方向伪影</th>\n<th>现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Perlin</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>二维仍常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simplex</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>高维首选（注意专利历史）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenSimplex</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>无专利顾虑的开源替代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中二维地形用 Perlin 足够，三维体素密度场或四维（含时间动画）则优先 Simplex 或 OpenSimplex。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分形布朗运动-叠出尺度层次\">分形布朗运动：叠出尺度层次</h2><p>单层 Perlin 只有一个尺度的起伏，看起来像平缓的丘陵，缺少真实地貌的细节层次。解决办法是分形布朗运动（fBm）：把同一噪声函数以不同频率与振幅叠加多次。每一层叫一个倍频（octave），频率逐层翻倍、振幅逐层衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>noise</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(x) = \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} A \\cdot g^{i} \\cdot \\text{noise}(x \\cdot f \\cdot l^{i})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0691em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">noise</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1247em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 是频率倍率（lacunarity，常取 2），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是振幅衰减（gain/persistence，常取 0.5）。低倍频贡献大尺度山脉轮廓，高倍频贡献岩石小起伏。调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 和倍频数，就能在&quot;平缓草原&quot;与&quot;嶙峋峭壁&quot;之间连续过渡——这是地形生成最核心的旋钮，<a href=\"../terrain-space/heightmap-terrain\">高度图与地形生成</a> 会把它用到极致。</p>\n<p>变体也很丰富：取噪声绝对值得到脊状噪声（ridged noise）造山脊，用噪声扰动采样坐标得到域扭曲（domain warping）造蜿蜒河谷与大理石纹。这些都是在 fBm 骨架上的花样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"噪声-随机与可控性的关系\">噪声、随机与可控性的关系</h2><p>噪声的强大也是它的弱点：它给你连续好看的场，却几乎不给你局部精确控制。你能调全局的频率振幅，却很难命令&quot;在坐标 (300,500) 处必须有个山口&quot;。这正是构造式方法可控性低的根源（见 <a href=\"pcg-overview\">PCG 概念与分类</a>）。当需求从&quot;好看的地貌&quot;升级到&quot;满足硬约束的关卡&quot;时，纯噪声就力不从心，必须引入约束求解或搜索——这条升级路径，是第三章 <a href=\"../search-grammar/\">搜索与语法方法</a> 的主题。如何量化&quot;好看&quot;与&quot;可控&quot;本身，则交给 <a href=\"controllability-evaluation\">可控性与质量评估</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PCG 用伪随机数而非真随机，核心价值是种子带来的可复现性，这是分块流式生成的基石。</li>\n<li>选 PRNG 看周期、均匀性与速度，现代游戏偏爱 PCG/xoshiro 系列；层级种子让区块可并行生成。</li>\n<li>梯度噪声（Perlin/Simplex）通过格点梯度+平滑插值把白噪声变成空间连续的自然场。</li>\n<li>Simplex 用单纯形把高维复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，高维与动画场景首选。</li>\n<li>分形布朗运动通过多倍频叠加造出尺度层次，gain 与倍频数是地形最核心的旋钮。</li>\n<li>噪声擅长全局美观、拙于局部精确控制，需求升级到硬约束时须转向搜索与约束求解。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"随机性与噪声函数","id":"随机性与噪声函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"伪随机数与种子的可复现性","id":"伪随机数与种子的可复现性"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度噪声：Perlin 与 Simplex","id":"梯度噪声-perlin-与-simplex"},{"level":2,"text":"分形布朗运动：叠出尺度层次","id":"分形布朗运动-叠出尺度层次"},{"level":2,"text":"噪声、随机与可控性的关系","id":"噪声-随机与可控性的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PCG 概念与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations/pcg-overview"},"next":{"title":"可控性与质量评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations/controllability-evaluation"}}